Short:        MUI-Brush Expander, developer files
Author:       Johannes Beigel
Uploader:     Martin Schulze <masc coli uni-sb de>
Type:         dev/c
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

MBE expands the amount of MUI-Brushes. The user can configure these  new
'MBE-Brushes' similar to normal MUI-Brushes.

This is the developer archive.
